 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Of course. How old are they? Great. Pick a spot that's not too far from water and shade, and that's flat and level. Cutting the grapes gives kids something to hold and talks about different colors. Set up a blanket with a few toys for the kids to share. A frisbee games are always popular. Set up a tent so the kids have a cool, shaded spot. Yes, a pack of baby wipes and a spare blanket in case it gets messy.",
